&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</description></item><item><title>2018 to do list</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2018-10-14-2018-to-do-list/</link><pubDate>Sun, 14 Oct 2018 15:30:52 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2018-10-14-2018-to-do-list/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;迫于最近的事情有点多，还是记录一下。 果然to do list什么的，还是要按照年份记录啊。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>20171214</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2017-12-14-20171214/</link><pubDate>Thu, 14 Dec 2017 12:31:33 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2017-12-14-20171214/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;记得之前被人在群里刷“宽神是我们的红太阳”还不理解&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>